    seed_native_inline_if_else_or_chain_false_2026-11-27, 0, "Rust seed native codegen evaluates a value-producing inline if/else whose else arm is a short-circuit or/and chain to false (observed in ladder run 45916738302 rung 2 hello build blocking worker reap with sealed=-1). Source workaround converts the expression to plain statements in shard_worker_reaped_stopped_v1 at src/app/cli/shard_worker_reap_v1.spl:217-229; Rust seed native codegen fix remains open."

